0226+  1303             ; T COMMAND TOGGLE SINGLE STEPPER (IF INSTALLED)
0227+  1303             ;-----------------------------------------------
0228+  1303             ; The single stepper is (now) controlled by bit 7
0229+  1303             ; of the REFRESH register:
0230+  1303             ; B7 = 1 single stepper is enabled
0231+  1303             ; B7 = 0 single stepper is disabled
0232+  1303             ; 
0233+  1303             ; The previous version of the single stepper hardware
0234+  1303             ; used the spare IO port (PORT7) to toggle a flip-flop.
0235+  1303             ; 
